    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92490" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥῑνόκερως</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ωτος</span>,
			ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥίς</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the Rhinoceros</i> or
				<i>Nose-horn</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Callix.
				2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				16.4.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				17.44
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.1302
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Praeneste</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. λίθος</span>, of its horn, <i><span class="en">
				Cyran.
				36
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>wild bull</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aq.
				<u>Jb.</u>
				39.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ps.</u>
				28(29).9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιὸς ὄρνις ἐν
				Αἰθιοπίᾳ</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (perh. <i>hornbill</i>).</div>
